course: dictionary
lesson: 8759
title: Seventh: order and fractions
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Seventh is an order word. It tells you the place of something in a line: first, second, third, and so on, up to seventh. «On the seventh day God rested.» Here seventh means the day that comes after the sixth day, in position number 7.
explain: Seventh can also be a fraction. A seventh is one of seven equal parts of a whole, written 1/7. Context tells you which meaning you need. «Some fairy wasps are only about a seventh of a millimetre long.» Here a seventh is a fraction, one part of a millimetre split into seven equal parts.
explain: Check by swapping in a meaning. Ask: does it mean "number 7 in order" or "one of seven equal parts"? If the sentence makes sense with "the seventh one in the line", it is an order word.
fact: Seventh means number 7 in order, after the sixth.
fact: A seventh is one of seven equal parts of a whole, written 1/7.
fact: Seventh is written 7th when you use numbers, as in 7th grade or the 7th floor.
fact: A seventh of 28 is 4, because 28 shared into 7 equal parts gives 4 in each part.
fact: «In seventh heaven» means very happy.
exercise: In the line of runners, Mia finished seventh. What place did Mia finish? | *Seventh | Sixth | Ninth | Eighth
exercise: What is a seventh of 28? | 7 | *4 | 21 | 3
exercise: «She was in seventh heaven when she won the prize.» What does «in seventh heaven» mean? | Very far away | Very tired | *Very happy | Very cold
test: «Some fairy wasps are only about a seventh of a millimetre long.» Here, a seventh is a | *Fraction, one of seven equal parts | Kind of animal | Place in a line | Day of the week
test: A pizza is cut into seven equal slices. One slice is how many sevenths of the pizza? | One half | Seven sevenths | Two sevenths | *One seventh
exam: Which phrase uses seventh as an order word, not a fraction? | a seventh of the cake | three sevenths of the class | half a seventh of a metre | *the seventh floor of the building
